      "title": {
        "en": "Transformative behavioral and obedience training"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners report exceptional improvements in canine behavior, particularly for reactive, anxious, or hyperactive pets. Reviewers emphasize that dogs master essential commands such as place, heel, and recall, stop pulling on leashes or barking at guests, and return home notably calmer, self-regulated, and disciplined."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Knowledgeable and supportive coaching team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise lead trainer Giann Manuel, coordinator Erika, and the training staff for their patience, clear guidance, and genuine dedication. Reviewers appreciate that trainers spend substantial one-on-one time coaching owners during pickup and offer follow-up sessions and group classes to reinforce habits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent updates and ongoing communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the center for sending frequent updates, including photos and video clips detailing their dog's daily progress throughout boarding programs. Reviewers note that staff answer questions promptly, provide thorough instructions, and maintain proactive communication that gives families peace of mind."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What boarding and training programs are available at GIFMAF?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The center offers 10-day, 14-day, and 30-day board and train programs tailored to basic obedience and intensive behavioral rehabilitation."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the center provide video updates during the dog's stay?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently mention receiving daily photos and progress videos showing their dog practicing commands."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are owners taught how to continue the training at home?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, trainers conduct detailed handover sessions at pickup, provide home visits when needed, and host monthly group classes for ongoing practice."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
